1773850463"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/6e068dd80c8d25691927a1de64cb879332fbe472/ss_6e068dd80c8d25691927a1de64cb879332fbe472.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773850463","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/6e068dd80c8d25691927a1de64cb879332fbe472/ss_6e068dd80c8d25691927a1de64cb879332fbe472.600x338.jpg?t=1773850463"}],"short_description":"Fall into a chill survival adventure, with a talking campfire as your guide. Explore, craft, fish and hunt during the day, and ask your fire three questions each night. Choose wisely: Winter isn't the only surprise in this beautiful, hand-drawn world. Playable in cosy or realistic mode.","steam_appid":3673960,"support_info":{"email":"admin@littlebuffalostudios.com","url":"https://discord.gg/NCYtbeavJH"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/littlebuffalostudios/akiiwan-chill-survival-game-with-a-talking-camp-fire/"}